---
import Layout from '../../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import PageHero from '../../../components/PageHero.astro';
import CtaBand from '../../../components/CtaBand.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Drilling"
  description="Drilling, tapping, counterboring, countersinking, and boring on Sector Technology cutting machines — consolidate part production onto one gantry."
>
  <PageHero
    eyebrow="Processes"
    title="Drilling"
    crumbs={[{ label: 'Home', href: '/' }, { label: 'Processes' }, { label: 'Drilling' }]}
    intro="Consolidate part production onto one machine, and produce large parts that most machining centers can't handle."
  />

  <section class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-4 py-12 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <p class="text-base leading-relaxed text-brand-steel-700">
      Drilling on a cutting machine is an excellent way to condense part production onto one
      machine. It reduces part handling because the customer can complete all processes on one
      machine, and it allows production of very large parts that could not otherwise be processed
      in most machining centers.
    </p>
    <p class="mt-6 text-base leading-relaxed text-brand-steel-700">
      Sector Technology provides several differently sized spindles on several of our gantries,
      giving customers the capability of drilling, tapping, counterboring, countersinking, and
      boring directly on the machine. This process is available on both water tables and
      down-draft tables, with different tool-cooling systems.
    </p>

    <h2 class="mt-10 text-xl font-bold text-brand-navy-950">Related</h2>
    <ul class="mt-4 flex flex-wrap gap-3 text-sm">
      <li><a href="/processes/plasma/" class="rounded-md border border-brand-steel-300 px-4 py-2 font-semibold text-brand-navy-950 hover:bg-brand-steel-100">Plasma Cutting</a></li>
      <li><a href="/processes/oxy-fuel/" class="rounded-md border border-brand-steel-300 px-4 py-2 font-semibold text-brand-navy-950 hover:bg-brand-steel-100">Oxy-Fuel Cutting</a></li>
      <li><a href="/machines/sti-800hd/" class="rounded-md border border-brand-steel-300 px-4 py-2 font-semibold text-brand-navy-950 hover:bg-brand-steel-100">STI-800HD drilling capacity</a></li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <CtaBand
    title="Need drilling or tapping on your next gantry?"
    body="Let us know your part size and spindle requirements and we'll spec the right machine."
  />
</Layout>
